IamApi --> SignInApiEndpoint : delegates to
IamApi --> PasswordRecoveryApiEndpoint : delegates to
IamApi ..> SignUpCommand : sends
IamApi ..> SignInCommand : sends
IamApi ..> RequestPasswordResetCommand : sends
IamApi ..> ResetPasswordCommand : sends
iamGuard --> IamStore : uses
iamInterceptor --> IamStore : uses
PasswordRecoveryAssembler ..> PasswordRecoveryRequest : converts
PasswordRecoveryAssembler ..> PasswordResetRequest : converts
PasswordRecoveryAssembler ..> RequestPasswordResetCommand : converts
PasswordRecoveryAssembler ..> ResetPasswordCommand : converts
SignInAssembler ..> SignInCommand : converts
SignInAssembler ..> SignInRequest : converts
SignInAssembler ..> SignInResource : converts
SignInAssembler ..> SignInResponse : converts
SignInAssembler --> User : builds
SignUpAssembler ..> SignUpCommand : converts
SignUpAssembler ..> SignUpRequest : converts
SignUpAssembler ..> SignUpResource : converts
SignUpAssembler ..> SignUpResponse : converts
SignInResource --|> BaseResource : extends
SignInResponse --|> BaseResponse : extends
SignInResponse --|> SignInResource : extends
SignUpResource --|> BaseResource : extends
SignUpResponse --|> BaseResponse : extends
SignUpResponse --|> SignUpResource : extends
AuthLayout --> LanguageSwitcher : contains
ForgotPasswordForm --> IamStore : uses
ForgotPasswordForm --> AuthLayout : contains
ResetPasswordForm --> IamStore : uses
ResetPasswordForm --> AuthLayout : contains
SignInForm --> IamStore : uses
SignInForm --> AuthLayout : contains
SignUpForm --> IamStore : uses
SignUpForm --> UserRole : has
SignUpForm --> AuthLayout : contains
PasswordRecoveryApiEndpoint --> PasswordRecoveryAssembler : uses
SignInApiEndpoint --> SignInAssembler : uses
SignUpApiEndpoint --> SignUpAssembler : uses

@enduml
